    "locked": false,
    "maintainer_can_modify": true,
    "title": "build: avoid embedding depends paths in build RPATH",
    "user": {
      "login": "KvantaMechanic",
      "id": 190620839,
      "node_id": "U_kgDOC1ykpw",
      "avatar_url": "https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/190620839?v=4",
      "gravatar_id": "",
      "url": "https://api.github.com/users/KvantaMechanic",
      "html_url": "https://github.com/KvantaMechanic",
      "followers_url": "https://api.github.com/users/KvantaMechanic/followers",
      "following_url": "https://api.github.com/users/KvantaMechanic/following%7B/other_user%7D",
      "gists_url": "https://api.github.com/users/KvantaMechanic/gists%7B/gist_id%7D",
      "starred_url": "https://api.github.com/users/KvantaMechanic/starred%7B/owner%7D%7B/repo%7D",
      "subscriptions_url": "https://api.github.com/users/KvantaMechanic/subscriptions",
      "organizations_url": "https://api.github.com/users/KvantaMechanic/orgs",
      "repos_url": "https://api.github.com/users/KvantaMechanic/repos",
      "events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/KvantaMechanic/events%7B/privacy%7D",
      "received_events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/KvantaMechanic/received_events",
      "type": "User",
      "site_admin": false,
      "name": null,
      "patch_url": null
    },
    "body": "After PR #33247 removed CMAKE_SKIP_BUILD_RPATH from the CMake build system as part of changes related to Guix binary checks, Linux builds using the depends toolchain could embed the absolute depends/<host>/lib path in build-tree binaries.\r\n\r\nOne user-visible consequence was incorrect font rendering in the Bitcoin Core Qt GUI. Instead of rendering the bundled RobotoMono-Bold.ttf font as intended, the GUI could fall back to a system-provided font and sizing, resulting in text that was unpleasant to read and, in some cases, difficult to read.\r\n\r\nThis PR restores build-RPATH suppression specifically for the depends toolchain, without reverting the broader changes from #33247 or affecting Guix builds. It also prevents Linux binaries built with depends from containing the absolute depends library path in their RPATH/RUNPATH.\r\n\r\nTested on Linux x86_64 with depends builds on v31.1 and current master. After this change, bitcoin-qt, bitcoin-gui, and test_bitcoin-qt contain no RPATH/RUNPATH, and their generated link commands contain no -Wl,-rpath.",
